    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841480/extras/7b005a082340adf6323dc38cfa8a2704.avif?t=1753459274\" width=1421 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841480/extras/1db91b2d0614ad859536a942be5038fa.poster.webp?t=1753459274\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841480/extras/1db91b2d0614ad859536a942be5038fa.webp?t=1753459274\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1280 height=300 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841480/extras/7b005a082340adf6323dc38cfa8a2704.avif?t=1753459274\" width=1421 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Sweet Summer</strong> is a visual novel about flirting, chance encounters, and those short moments that somehow stay with us the longest.<br>It\u2019s a series of stories about a guy named Alex \u2014 a charming player with a quick smile, fast reactions, and a heart that\u2019s not as simple as it seems. He\u2019s not looking for love\u2026 but love tends to find him anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841480/extras/7b005a082340adf6323dc38cfa8a2704.avif?t=1753459274\" width=1421 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841480/extras/f32fb19d2281ecc751f228024ab20184.poster.webp?t=1753459274\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841480/extras/f32fb19d2281ecc751f228024ab20184.webp?t=1753459274\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=640 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841480/extras/7b005a082340adf6323dc38cfa8a2704.avif?t=1753459274\" width=1421 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today \u2014 a train ride.<br>Yesterday \u2014 a loud party at an old friend's place.<br>Each time \u2014 a new meeting, a new girl, a new game.<br>You make the choices. You decide how far it goes.<br>Will you be just a passerby \u2014 or someone unforgettable?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841480/extras/7b005a082340adf6323dc38cfa8a2704.avif?t=1753459274\" width=1421 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841480/extras/472c5d79155b260017095f744b923463.poster.webp?t=1753459274\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841480/extras/472c5d79155b260017095f744b923463.webp?t=1753459274\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=640 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841480/extras/7b005a082340adf6323dc38cfa8a2704.avif?t=1753459274\" width=1421 height=75 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcac Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 Romance, light flirting, and choices with consequences<br>\ud83c\udfad Dynamic dialogue, unexpected twists, and steamy scenes<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Original 2.5D anime-style visuals with a focus on atmosphere<br>\ud83d\udd0d Mini-games, hidden events, and a touch of humor<br>\ud83d\udcf1 Perfectly playable with one hand. Or in one night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Sweet Summer</strong> isn\u2019t a story about true love.<br>It\u2019s a story about feelings that show up fast...<br>\u2026and stay longer than you'd expect.</p>",
